{
  "id": "1KI.19",
  "number": "19",
  "bookId": "1KI",
  "reference": "1 Abarwoti 19",
  "copyright": "© 2021 KENBS",
  "verseCount": 21,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "19",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1KI 19"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "19",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Elija ore ase egetunwa gia Sinai",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahabu agateebia Yesebeli amang’ana onsi Elija akorete, buna aitete ababani bonsi n’omoro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Yesebeli agatoma omonto ase Elija, akamoteebia: “Tiga chinyasae ching’e egesusuro ekenene, na goetania ekio, onye ankio ase engaki enga buna eye tingokora obogima bwao bobe buna obw’oyomo bw’abwo gwaitete.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elija akoboa, akaimoka agatama ase ogotooria obogima bwaye, agaika Beeri‐Seba ase ense ya Yuda. Agatiga omosomba oye aroro,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na ere omonyene akagenda ase erooro orogendo rwe rituko erimo, agaikaransa inse y’omote okorokwa omoretemu, agesabera ng’a akwe, akabora: “bono Omonene, aya aisanire, ira obogima bwane, ekiagera inche tindi omuya kobua chisokoro chiane.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase obotuko obwo Elija akaraara inse ase omote oria omoretemu, na aroro omomalaika agacha akamokuna akamoteebia: “Boka orie!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ere akarigereria, akarora ang’e nase omotwe oye omogati ogekeire igoro ase omorero bw’amakara na amaache are ase egetoono. Akaria na akanywa, erio akaraara.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende omomalaika oria bw’Omonene agacha eria kabere, akamokuna, akamoteebia: “Imoka orie, ekiagera orogendo norotambe okogenda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elija akaboka, akaria, akanywa, na ase chinguru chi’endagera eyio akayegendera ase engaki y’amatuko emerongo ene, omobaso na obotuko, agaika Horebu, egetunwa kia Nyasae.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aroro agasoa rikuruma ime, akaraarao ase obotuko boria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ring’ana ri’Omonene rigacha asare, rikamoboria: “Elija, ninki ogokora ime aa?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akairaneria: “Nabeire ne risemi asore aye Omonene, Nyasae bw’Emeganda, ekiagera Abaisraeli batigire okobwatana kwao kw’ogotianania, batagoire ebisasimero biao, naende baitire ababani bao nemioro. Inche bweka natigaire; na bono nigo bakorigia basirie obogima bwane.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene akamoteebia: “Soka ogende, otenene ase egetunwa igoro agwo ase obosio bwane inche Omonene!” Eri’Omonene agaeta agwo, na omwaga ore ne chinguru ogatandora ebitunwa na gwata amagena ’ebitare agwo ase obosio bw’Omonene, korende Omonene tarenge ime ase omwaga oria. Na ekero omwaga oerire, omotengecho bw’ense ogaacha, korende Omonene tarenge ase omotengecho oria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ekero omotengecho oerire, omorero ogoka, korende Omonene tarenge ime ase omorero oria, na magega y’ayio eriogi rike ri’obotoereru rigacha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ekero Elija aigwete eriogi riria, agatuba obosio bwaye negetambaa kiaye gi’okwambara, agasoka isiko, agatenena ase egesoero kie rikuruma riria; na agwo eriogi rigacha asare, rigakwana, rikamoboria: “Elija, ninki ogokora aiga?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akairaneria: “Nabeire ne risemi asore aye Omonene, Nyasae bw’Emeganda, ekiagera Abaisraeli batigire okobwatana kwao kw’ogotianania, batagoire ebisasimero biao, na baitire ababani bao n’omoro, na inche bweka natigaire, nabarabwo igo bakorigia obogima bwane babosirie.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene akamoteebia: “Irana, ogende enchera yao goika ase erooro ya Damesiki; na ekero oraike aroro, oake Hasaeli amaguta, omobeke abe omorwoti igoro y’Abasiiria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende Yehu, mosinto o Nimusi, omoake amaguta, omobeke abe omorwoti igoro y’Abaisraeli; na Elisha, mosinto o Safati, korwa Abeli‐Mehola omoake amaguta, abe omobani ase ribaga riao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na onde bwensi oratame atooreke korwa ase omoro bwa Hasaeli naitwe na Yehu; na onde bwensi oratame atooreke korwa ase omoro o Yehu naitwe n’Elisha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende nonya naboigo, nintigare nabaanto chilifu isano na ibere b’Abaisraeli bonsi, baria batabegete amaru abo inse ase ogosasiima Baali, gose koyenyunyunta.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Elisha okorangerigwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio akarua agwo, akagenda akanyora Elisha, mosinto o Safati, okoremia chiombe; ebisangio bi’echiombe ikomi na bibere nigo biarenge bosio bwaye. Ere omonyene nigo arenge negesangio gia ikomi na kabere. Elija agaeta agwo, akarutera Elisha egetambaa kiaye ambarete",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elisha agatiga chiombe chiria, akaminyoka gochia ase Elija, akamoteebia: “Tiga ngende konyunyunta tata na baba ase okobatiga, erio nkobwatie.” Elija akamoteebia: “Irana ogende, nomanyete aya nagokoreire.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio agatiga Elija, akairana, akanyenya chiombe chiaye ibere, akaiyeka chinyama ase omorero bw’amakorogoto aria, akaa abanto chinyama chiria, nabarabwo bakaria. Erio akaimoka akabwatia Elija, akaba okomokorera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
